  <h1>Software Architecture, AI and Sustainability</h1>
  <p class="lede">My research asks how architectural decisions can help intelligent systems remain adaptable, dependable, and sustainable.
  Further, how to leverage AI to architect software systems that are self-sustainable.
  </p>
</header>

